<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Clinic share issue raises 49.69 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Clinic share issue raises 49.69 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clinic Holdings Ltd announced on Tuesday that it had issued 9.8 million shares of one cent each at an issue price of 507 cents each in terms of a placing of shares for cash of 49.69 million rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
